  "message_id": "FUKA_PARTY_HPTP15_2",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 92 03}队长！\n请不要再勉强了！\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
